sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Cl as Client
    participant GW as API gateway
    participant Q as Request queue
    participant W as Model worker
    participant GPU as GPU
    Cl->>GW: request with a token budget
    GW->>Q: enqueue with priority
    Note over Q,W: workers pull — a pushed request lands on a busy GPU and waits
    W->>Q: pull when it has batch room
    W->>GPU: add to the running batch
    loop decode steps
        GPU-->>W: next tokens for every sequence in the batch
        W-->>Cl: stream each sequence's token
    end
    alt the batch is full
        Q-->>Cl: queued — surface the wait, do not time out silently
    end
    Note over W,GPU: continuous batching keeps the GPU busy between arrivals
